## Critical Patterns

```php
// Always wrap hooks
public function hookAnyHook($params) {
    try {
        // logic
    } catch (Exception $e) {
        PrestaShopLogger::addLog('TwoPayment: ' . $e->getMessage(), 3);
        return;
    }
}
```

```javascript
// Always wrap JS init
waitForJQuery(function() {
    // Safe to use jQuery
});
```

